449	/* GPIO40 now belongs to bk7258_status_led.c, which drives it as the red
450	 * half of the two-colour status indicator.  This heartbeat writer kept
451	 * toggling the same pin once a second and its writes landed between the
452	 * status writer's, which showed up as a red flicker during the green idle
453	 * blink.  The liveness proof the heartbeat existed for is carried by the
454	 * status LED's idle pattern, so the writer is retired; the call sites stay
455	 * so the surrounding sequencing is unchanged.
